      "data": {
        "title": "4. How do Method and Script relate?",
        "body": "A Method has declared effects and is what a Handler invokes; a Script is executable source with a wider remit. It is not clear from the code whether a Method is a kind of Script, a Script with a contract, or a separate thing. Read `MethodNode.js`, `ScriptNode.js` and `usePluginRuntime.js` before deciding, and say which the two specs should claim. Tasks 13 and 14 both depend on this.",
        "status": "open",
        "owner": "",
        "prominence": "high",
        "_classBinding": {
