      "data": {
        "title": "5. Where do the specs live and publish?",
        "body": "Today they live in `mikemartinez1974/public/primitives` only. Task graphs and the app's bundled library publish through the twilite-zone repo. Should the specs be mirrored there, so the public site and the app's own reader can open them, or stay in the private library? This decides the links inside them and the test in task 17.",
